        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan perkataan “sub-contractor for labour”, di mana-mana jua terdapat, dengan perkataan “contractor for labour”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/15/msa@/~cl_22__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
